    <statement><p>For each sentence below, decide whether it is an atomic statement, a molecular statement, or not a statement at all.</p>
<p><ol>
<li>
<p>Some say the end is near, and some say we'll see Armageddon soon.</p>
</li>
<li>
<p>Mom's coming 'round to put it back the way it ought to be.</p>
</li>
<li>
<p>Learn to swim.</p>
</li>
</ol></p>
</statement>
